#
# No non-default ESP-IDF configuration is required to build this instrument.
#
# The generated sdkconfig is 2461 lines and every setting that matters is the
# esp32s3 default: single-app partition table, 2 MB image, standard main-task
# stack. It is gitignored rather than committed, because committing 2461
# generated lines to record "we changed nothing" obscures the one fact worth
# recording, which is this sentence.
#
# If a setting ever does need changing, put it HERE rather than editing the
# generated file, so the delta from default stays legible.
